This project is a fine-tune of Kokoro-82M and a portable runtime for it. It
stands on other people's work. Credit, in the order it matters:

================================================================================
VOICE DATA — the recordings the voice was learned from
================================================================================

  Alba speech corpus
  Valentini-Botinhao, Cassia; Yamagishi, Junichi. (2019).
  Alba speech corpus [dataset]. University of Edinburgh.
  The Centre for Speech Technology Research (CSTR).
  https://doi.org/10.7488/ds/2506

  License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)

  ** NON-STANDARD TERM — read it. ** The corpus license explicitly preserves
  the voice talent's moral rights, including the right of integrity, and
  forbids uses that would be derogatory to the voice talent. Plain CC BY does
  not say this; this dataset adds it. Anything built on these weights inherits
  that condition.

  The audio is NOT redistributed here. Get it from the DOI above.

